{"descriptionModels":[{"description":"With a few minutes of preparation, a bit of improvisation, and some talent, you can appear proficient in just about anything. You gain the following benefits:\n\n- Increase one of your Ability Scores by 1, to a maximum of 20.\n\n- When you finish a long rest, you can spend 10 minutes practicing with a simple or martial weapon, skill, or tool, or in the use of a cantrip from the any spell list. You gain proficiency with that weapon, skill, or tool, or you learn that cantrip and you can use any of your mental ability scores (Intelligence, Wisdom, Charisma) for attack rolls or ability checks with that weapons, skil, tool or cantrip until you use this feature again.","level":1}],"id":"Customa9d1b04d-b91c-46cc-8b67-eb57e7c52f66","isFeature":false,"jsonType":"feat","level":1,"name":"Dilettante [VSS] [SM]","notes":"","type":"Feat"}